<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b>RUSH ENTERPRISES, INC. REPORTS SECOND QUARTER 2023 RESULTS, </b><br>
<b>ANNOUNCES THREE-FOR-TWO STOCK SPLIT AND $0.17 PER SHARE DIVIDEND (POST-STOCK SPLIT)</b></p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&nbsp;</p>

