			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Board declares a post-stock split cash dividend of $0.17 per share of Class A and Class B common stock, representing a 21.4% increase</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

